436 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Capital One offers a comprehensive set of financial products, including deposit accounts, loans, credit cards, mutual funds, and Guaranteed Investment Certificates \(GIC\) products, to the needs of consumers. With a vast network of over 750 offices across the United States. Capital One addresses diverse funding needs such as the Business Grant Program for Black-Owned Businesses, awarding $10,000 grants to 170 businesses. The company also promotes supplier diversity through developmental programs like Catapult, SAGE Advice, and the Diverse Supplier Mentoring Program, emphasizing mentorship, networking, and cash grants for underrepresented entrepreneurs. Furthermore, as a partner in Strive USA, led by the Mastercard Center for Inclusive Growth, Capital One contributes to the program's goal of supporting five million businesses over the next five years. )
/E (Capital One offers a comprehensive set of financial products, including deposit accounts, loans, credit cards, mutual funds, and Guaranteed Investment Certificates \(GIC\) products, to the needs of consumers. With a vast network of over 750 offices across the United States. Capital One addresses diverse funding needs such as the Business Grant Program for Black-Owned Businesses, awarding $10,000 grants to 170 businesses. The company also promotes supplier diversity through developmental programs like Catapult, SAGE Advice, and the Diverse Supplier Mentoring Program, emphasizing mentorship, networking, and cash grants for underrepresented entrepreneurs. Furthermore, as a partner in Strive USA, led by the Mastercard Center for Inclusive Growth, Capital One contributes to the program's goal of supporting five million businesses over the next five years. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
