<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T ( Improving this part of the culture can play a key role in reducing stress and providing a more resourceful environment. The fact that 37.5% of employees believe that Capital One has either low or very low diversity, while only 18.8% view it as very high, highlights the need for change. This indicates that the current culture lacks sufficient inclusivity and diversity and needs reformation. The implementation of the Dive plan \(pg. 13\) will significantly elevate these statistics.)
/E ( Improving this part of the culture can play a key role in reducing stress and providing a more resourceful environment. The fact that 37.5% of employees believe that Capital One has either low or very low diversity, while only 18.8% view it as very high, highlights the need for change. This indicates that the current culture lacks sufficient inclusivity and diversity and needs reformation. The implementation of the Dive plan \(pg. 13\) will significantly elevate these statistics.)
